- Monthly check-in modal: weight, optional tape measures, progress photo
  (downscaled to stay within localStorage), and energy/sleep/motivation
  emoji ratings, plus "biggest win" and "next focus". Worth +50 XP.
- Progress report card on submit: deltas vs last check-in (weight,
  measurements), days trained, month streak, ratings, then/now photos,
  and any newly unlocked badges — with a confetti celebration.
- Monthly checkpoints section + timeline in Progress, with an inviting
  "check-in is ready" nudge banner on Today when a new month is due.
- Reminders card: monthly check-in nudge + daily workout reminder with a
  time, notification permission, and local scheduling while the app is
  open. In-app nudges are the always-reliable fallback.
- 3 new badges (Checkpoint, Transformation, Year of You), help entries,
  backup/restore of reminder prefs, and SW cache bump to v19 with a
  notificationclick handler.
