- Delta coloring is now goal-aware: waist smaller = good; muscle sites
  (chest/arms/thighs) bigger = good on a bulk, smaller on a cut; neutral
  when maintaining. Applied to the report card and the checkpoint timeline
  via a shared deltaChip helper.
- Checkpoints card shows a weight-across-months trend chart once there are
  two or more check-ins (reuses the inline-SVG line).
- Monthly check-in reminder gets its own time picker, wired into the local
  notification scheduler independently of the workout reminder; reminder
  prefs merge one level deep so existing users pick up the new time field.
- Report card can share/save a canvas-drawn progress image (month, weight
  delta, streak, days trained, win) via the Web Share API with a PNG
  download fallback.
- SW cache bumped to v20.
